Bunsen burner based on Friuzza et al (2003) set up

H2 + CH4 mixtures at diffrent equialnec rations

Using Kee mechanism

To generate a 1D flame use the script in Kee folder

cd Kee/
python 1d-flame-run.py

The flame can be seen by executing in 
python ~/codes/cerisse/tools/combustion/1d-flame-plot.py

Burn/equilibrium conditiuons can be seen by

cd Kee/
python equil_from_equivalenceratio.py

NOTE: This are modified copies of scripts in tools/combustion
